{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "DizzyLab 上的全部社团和厂牌会显示在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every circle and label on DizzyLab will appear here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NeoDizzy 是非官方的开源第三方客户端，与 DizzyLab 及其运营方不存在隶属、合作或授权关系。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NeoDizzy is an unofficial, open-source third-party client. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or authorized by DizzyLab or its operators."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "专辑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Album"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "专辑和社团的搜索结果会显示在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matching albums and labels will appear here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "专辑浏览": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Browse Albums"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "免责声明": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disclaimer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关注": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Following"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关注的社团": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Followed Labels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "即将推出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coming Soon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发现": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discover"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pack"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已购与已下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Purchased & Downloaded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开源许可": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我的": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开个人页面": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opens your account page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排行榜": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "搜索": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "搜索专辑、社团": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search albums and labels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "搜索结果": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search Results"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数字专辑、单曲 EP、下载商品和限时优惠会显示在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digital albums, singles & EPs, downloads and limited-time deals will appear here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未登录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not Signed In"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本项目出于学习与研究目的开发，通过 DizzyLab 网站本身提供的页面和接口获取信息。网站变化可能导致功能随时失效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It is built for learning and research and reads information from the pages and endpoints the DizzyLab website itself serves. Changes to the site may break features at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本项目按 GPLv3 许可证提供，不附带任何担保；使用本项目产生的风险由使用者自行承担。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This project is provided under the GPLv3 license without any warranty. You use it at your own risk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "版本": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用户主页": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Profile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录 DizzyLab 账号": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign In to DizzyLab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录后可以听完整版、购买和下载已购专辑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in to stream full tracks, buy albums and download your purchases."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录后显示你买过的专辑；下载到文件夹里的专辑可以离线播放。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in to see the albums you bought. Albums downloaded to your folder play offline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录后，你关注的社团发布的新作会显示在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in to see new releases from the labels you follow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "社团": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Labels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "社团列表": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All Labels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "访问 DizzyLab 官网": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Visit the DizzyLab Website"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请支持并尊重创作者：购买后下载的作品仅供个人使用，不要上传发布到任何公开的网络空间（包括免费作品）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please support and respect the creators: downloaded works are for personal use only. Do not upload or publish them anywhere public, free releases included."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "账号凭据只保存在本机的钥匙串中，不会发送到 DizzyLab 以外的任何地方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your account credentials are kept only in this device's Keychain and are never sent anywhere other than DizzyLab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "账号功能正在开发中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Account features are still being built."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个页面还在开发中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This page is still being built."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "随便听听": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shuffle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音乐库": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Library"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
